TASK: Write a summary of the whole script in 3 to 4 sentences and at most 90 words. Tell the story itself: who the characters are, what happens, the turn, and the open question it leaves. Write it as plain prose for a producer; do not label the parts (no "The setup is", "The conflict is") and do not evaluate quality. Use only facts the script states: do not add who died, why something happened, or any detail that is not on the page.
Story logline for context: {{ logline }}
